          "a": "Find the minimum number of coins needed to make up a given amount using DP.",
          "e": "Bottom-up DP: dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[i - coin] + 1) for each coin in coins.",
          "code": "import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static int coinChange(int[] coins, int amount) {\n        int[] dp = new int[amount + 1];\n        Arrays.fill(dp, amount + 1);\n        dp[0] = 0;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= amount; i++) {\n            for (int c : coins) {\n                if (i >= c) dp[i] = Math.min(dp[i], dp[i - c] + 1);\n            }\n        }\n        return dp[amount] > amount ? -1 : dp[amount];\n    }\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(\"Min coins: \" + coinChange(new int[]{1, 2, 5}, 11));\n    }\n}",
