          "q": "What are the 4 Coffman conditions for Deadlock and how do you prevent them?",
          "a": "Deadlock requires: 1. Mutual Exclusion (resource held exclusively), 2. Hold and Wait (holding one lock while waiting for another), 3. No Preemption (resource cannot be forcibly taken), 4. Circular Wait (T1 waits for T2, T2 waits for T1).",
