          "a": "ClassLoaders load .class bytecodes into JVM memory. The hierarchy: 1. Bootstrap ClassLoader (loads core rt.jar / java.base), 2. Platform/Extension ClassLoader, 3. Application/System ClassLoader (loads classpath). It follows Delegation Principle: a loader always delegates to its parent before searching locally.",
