          "q": "Caching strategies: Cache-Aside vs Write-Through vs Write-Behind (Write-Back)?",
          "a": "Cache-Aside (Lazy Loading): app reads cache; if miss, reads DB and populates cache; on write, app invalidates/updates DB and evicts cache. Write-Through: app writes to cache, cache synchronously writes to DB before returning. Write-Behind (Write-Back): app writes to cache, cache acknowledges immediately and batches writes to DB asynchronously (high throughput, risk of data loss on crash).",
