          "a": "Handshake: 1. Client sends SYN (seq=x). 2. Server replies SYN-ACK (seq=y, ack=x+1). 3. Client sends ACK (ack=y+1) and connection is ESTABLISHED. Teardown: 1. Client sends FIN. 2. Server sends ACK. 3. Server sends FIN. 4. Client sends ACK and enters TIME_WAIT state (typically 2 * MSL = 60s) before closing.",
