          "q": "Thread Visibility Trap: Infinite Loop without Volatile or Sync",
          "a": "Without volatile or synchronization, a worker thread checking a boolean flag may cache the flag in a CPU register. Even when the main thread updates the flag, the worker thread may never observe the change, looping infinitely due to JIT optimizations.",
